  "description": "E222/T1412: unchanged full Cora GraphSAGE, C16/R16,R32,R64; three fresh compiles then nine independent one-inference runtimes in ABC/BCA/CAB order, immediate frozen numerical audit after every run. Each placement has three samples; no warmup excluded. Same-PE intervals and launch-to-completion-read host windows are separate, neither application E2E. No selective delivery speedup claim. E219 compile41-63s/run62-171s motivates90s/240s estimates; client1200/worker600/audit120s bounds, existing per-case128MiB and capture256MiB caps, controller2GiB output warning threshold (not a hard cap).",
